	(text "microSD: SPI now, 4-bit SDIO later. CLK, CMD and DAT0 on SPI0's SCK, TX and RX; DAT3 is the SPI\nchip select; DAT0-3 on consecutive GPIOs (36-39), as PIO SDIO needs."
