	(text "Q1: the card's 3.3 V, on unless GP43 drives the gate high. R48 pulls it\ndown (on) for firmware that doesn't know it: 4.7k, under the 8.2k that\nRP2350 erratum E9 asks of an external pull-down. Cutting the power\ntakes a card out of SPI mode and resets one that's stuck."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 132.08 187.96 0)
		(effects
